A||||14||rodmcneill||Fiero Store developing new products.||||1||
Z||000000||rodmcneill||11-30-2001||02:06 AM||||If you have not been on their web site recently you might want to check out the "R+D center". It looks like they are going to have quite a few parts reproduced that have been discontinued by GM. Its nice to see a company being actively involved in keeping our little plastic gems supplied. I have bought parts from them in the past and been very pleased with the service. I think this is a company the members on the Forum should support with their buying dollars. You do get a 10% discount on non GM parts if you mention you are a club member. I do like Rodney's parts also it's just that the Fiero Store has a little deeper pockets to produce some of these parts. Long live the Fiero venders!||||reg||1
Z||000001||Monkeyman||11-30-2001||02:20 AM||||I like dealing with individuals so if I can buy from Rodney, I will.  If Rodney doesn't have it and the FS does, I'll buy from them.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Master_Sushi||11-30-2001||02:26 AM||||85-88 4Cyl Performance Cams<BR>Custom ground performance roller cam shafts for 85-88 4Cyl models. Compatible with factory computer system.<P>Not for 84?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> Everybody overlooks/ignores 84s... I guess the rod/block is to weak or something.<P><BR>Clutch Pedal<BR>Steel aftermarket replacement for this recently discontinued GM original.<P>1988 Front Wheel Bearings<BR>Aftermarket replacements for the discontinued GM originals.<P>..Thank god we will have these again.<P><BR>edit "85 up 4 cyl Fieros switched to roller lifters" - thats why they arnt for 84  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Thanks Dave  <p>[This message has been edited by Master_Sushi (edited 11-30-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||artherd||11-30-2001||03:33 AM||||They do seem to be into our cars in a big way, and if it weren't for them, both of mine would be in sorry-arse shape indeed!<P>However, I'll buy from Rodney long before I'll buy from the FS.<P>Rodney rocks my world!<P>Best!<BR>Ben<P><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
